    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A neatly presented 3-bedroom detached bungalow that perfectly blends spacious country living with incredible potential. Set on a generous 0.5 acre site, this charming home features mature lawns, a gravel driveway, and a secure yard with gated dual access points. Inside, you will find a bright and airy kitchen, dining, and living area designed for modern family life, along with a unique attic office room reached by a feature spiral staircase.  \r\n\r\nFor those seeking extra space, this property is a rare find. It includes an attached garage with a built-in inspection pit, plus a substantial 9m x 9m detached store. Combined with high-speed fibre broadband and a backup aerial, these versatile spaces are perfect for a home business, workshop, or hobby hub. Located just 3km from Tarbert village on the Lower Ballylongford Road, you are within easy reach of local schools, shops, services and beaches in Beale & Ballybunion seaside resort.  \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised to fully appreciate everything Avondale and its exceptional grounds have to offer—call today to arrange your appointment!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 6.0m x 1.35m \r\nTiled flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.9m x 3.0m \r\nWith sliderobes and shelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2. - 3.3m x 2.9m \r\nWith fitted sliderobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m x 3.2m \r\nWith fitted sliderobe.\r\n\r\nShower Room - 2.6m x 1.8m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, electric shower, toilet, wash basin and fitted shelving.  \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area - 8.0m x 3.7m \r\nWith tiled and laminate flooring, solid fuel stove with back boiler and hot-press.  Feature spiral staircase to first floor, attic office and storage space.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - \r\nWith three-way aspect, tiled flooring, fitted kitchen, red deal latted ceiling and sliding patio door.\r\n\r\nLanding Area - 4.0m x 1.7m \r\nWith access to additional storage space.\r\n\r\nHome Office - 3.3m x 4.3m \r\nWith window and fitted radiator.\r\n\r\nAttached Garage - 7.0m x 4.5m \r\nWith pedestrian and vehicle roller door access, concrete floor with inspection chamber pit RSJ for heavy lifting, ample storage, oil fired boiler and pitched corrugated roof.\r\n\r\nDetached Garage/Workshop - 9.0m x 9.0m \r\nDetached purpose-built garage/workshop - twin leaf block cavity construction with steel frame and pitched clad roof, electric up and over doors, occupying a secure compact gravel yard with gated access to the rear of the dwelling.  Plastered render internally and externally, electric sockets and lights with independent fuse board.  Ridge height 4.3 m - Eaves height 3.2 m.\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double glazed PVC windows, PVC fascia and soffit and pitched tiled roof.\r\nLarge gravel rear yard with ample car parking.\r\nManicured front and rear garden with feature garden stone, mature hedge and trees.\r\nOn site septic tank and private on-site well. \r\nFibre broadband connected - Imagine aerial available."
      },
      {
